u-076","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws-ws1997726"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-038-wanghuilong:unit004","text":"其後劉義隆將到彦之檀道濟等頻頓淮潁大相侵掠慧龍力戰屢摧其鋒彦之與友人蕭斌書曰魯軌頽鈍馬楚麤狂亡人之中唯王慧龍及韓延之可為深憚不意儒生懦夫乃令老子訝之劉義隆縱反間云慧龍自以功髙而位不至欲引寇入邊因執安南大將軍司馬楚之以叛世祖聞曰此必不然是齊人忌樂毅耳乃賜慧龍璽書曰義隆畏將軍如虎欲相中害朕自知之風塵之言想不足介意也劉義隆計既不行復遣刺客呂𤣥伯購慧龍首二百户男絹一千匹𤣥伯偽為反間來求屏人有所論慧龍疑之使人探其懐有尺刀𤣥伯叩頭請死慧龍曰各為其主也吾不忍害此人左右皆言義隆賊心未已不殺𤣥伯無以制將來慧龍曰死生有命彼亦安能害我且吾方以仁義為干鹵又何憂乎刺客遂捨之時人服其寛恕","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"first_line":262,"last_line":276,"revision_id":"17b6525eb5aaa878b9640f5a61e90da934ce5fc4","source_layer":"received_biography","projection_sha256":"485bbf762d448da965f382373cceebbb52280d910e84ee8ef52c6ccc2914cf1a","raw_character_positions":[{"line":262,"column":10},{"line":262,"column":11},{"line":262,"column":12},{"line":262,"column":13},{"line":262,"column":14},{"line":262,"column":15},{"line":262,"column":16},{"line":262,"column":17},{"line":262,"column":18},{"line":262,"column":19},{"line":262,"column":20},{"line":263,"column":0},{"line":263,"column":1},{"line":263,"column":2},{"line":263,"column":3},{"line":263,"column":4},{"line":263,"column":5},{"line":263,"column":6},{"line":263,"column":7},{"line":263,"column":8},{"line":263,"column":9},{"line":263,"column":10},{"line":263,"column":11},{"line":263,"column":12},{"line":263,"column":13},{"line":263,"column":14},{"line":263,"column":15},{"line":263,"column":16},{"line":263,"column":17},{"line":263,"column":18},{"line":263,"column":19},{"line":263,"column":20},{"line":264,"column":0},{"line":264,"column":1},{"line":264,"column":2},{"line":264,"column":3},{"line":264,"column":4},{"line":264,"column":5},{"line":264,"column":6},{"line":264,"column":7},{"line":264,"column":8},{"line":264,"column":9},{"line":264,"column":10},{"line":264,"column":11},{"line":264,"column":12},{"line":264,"column":13},{"line":264,"column":14},{"line":264,"column":15},{"line":264,"column":16},{"line":264,"column":17},{"line":264,"column":